Wat je gaat doen As a Fashion Warehouse Associate at UPS, you play an important role in making sure clothing, lingerie, and fashion products are checked, prepared, and shipped to customers around the world.Your responsibilities include:- Checking clothing, lingerie, and accessories for quality;
- Preparing products for shipment;
- Picking orders using a hand scanner;
- Checking labels and product details;
- Processing returns;
- Sorting and packing fashion products;
- Keeping your workspace clean and organized;
- Helping other departments when needed.

   Wat we je bieden We believe in rewarding your hard work with a package that supports both your professional growth and personal well-being. Here’s what you can expect when you join our team:- Earn up to €18.75 per hour including shift allowance;
- Starting salary of €15.00 gross per hour;
- 25% shift allowance after 19:00;
- Work 32 to 40 hours per week;
- Work in a 2-shift schedule from 05:45 to 14:45 or from 14:45 to 23:45;
- 25 vacation days;
- 8.33% holiday allowance;
- Travel allowance up to €9.47 net per working day;
- Opportunities to grow within UPS;

Work in an international and diverse team.At Start People, you receive the same employment conditions as employees directly employed by UPS, including salary, allowances, and other benefits.   Functie-eisen We are looking for a detail-oriented and motivated team player ready to thrive in a dynamic fashion logistics environment.
You speak and understand English;
- You are available for 32 to 40 hours per week;
- You are willing to work in a 2-shift schedule;
- You are willing to do repetitive work;
- You work accurately and pay attention to details;
- You are motivated and flexible;
- No previous warehouse experience is required.

